    "abstract": "Parts figure for the translating sleeve blocker door link group, showing the link, the bushing, the clevis pin and retention set and the aft seal with its retainer hardware.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the blocker door link group on the translating sleeve, including the bushing, the clevis pin and retention set and the aft seal with its retainer.",
      "figure_note": "One link position is shown in detail and the figure applies to all positions on a half by repetition. The bushing is not separately illustrated because it is supplied fitted to the link on post-modification items and loose on pre-modification items; the two supply conditions are distinguished by the effectivity at item 10. The seal at item 20 has one lip pre-modification and two post-modification, which is the only visual difference between them and is easy to miss in the pack."
    },
